deft epub - commands (input -> output)
  info     epub -> report  Title, author, language, chapters, images, words
  from-md  md... -> epub   Make an e-book; each top-level heading starts a chapter
  to-md    epub -> md      Convert the whole book to Markdown
  to-pdf   epub -> pdf     Typeset the book as PDF
  to-text  epub -> txt     Extract plain text in reading order
More: deft epub <command> --help
